|> Exercise
    handle=_construct_signature_square_

    |> CodexSuggestion
        Can you construct a function of signature $[\s] \ra [\te{kg}]$
        from functions

        $$
        f : [\s] \ra [\m], \qquad g : [\m^2] \ra [\te{kg}]?
        $$

    |> Solution
        |> CodexSuggestion
            Yes: $g \circ f^2$, since $f^2 : [\s] \ra [\m^2]$.
